From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Logan Saunders <32494494+RealMrLogan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:40:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] display: stock UC1701 screen, fonts and ws2811 LEDs

Board init in stm32f1.c/stm32h7.c also drives fixed GPIOs (PB7/PA6, PB0/PE11).

Sovol's i2c changes are not carried over to master: on the F1 they made
i2c errors non-fatal and reset the bus, reporting each error to the host
as ldc1612_i2c_report. None was logged in the printer's klippy logs
(prints, meshes and calibrations, 2026-03 and 2026-11), and master now
returns i2c errors as status codes; an error shuts down as upstream does.
